    lomo:hasCapability "Dynamic database for geolocation and monitoring of spectrum usage opportunities.The database shall include up-to-date information collected and provided by Member States on the geolocalisation of existing uses of spectrum.This database shall be directly accessible to any prospective user of radio spectrum." ;
    dcterms:publisher <http://example.org/agent/odn> ;
